# Generated / disposable data
**/.vscode/
**/.dbtools/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/ideas/
**/log/
*.pyc
*.env
*.log
*.code-workspace

# Local Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Local lint tools / package installs
.pre-commit/
.ruff_cache/
